@startuml
!include https://raw.githubusercontent.com/plantuml-stdlib/C4-PlantUML/master/C4_Context.puml

title TWS录音系统完整解决方案时序图 - 缓存感知型Flash存储架构

actor 用户 as User
participant "充电盒" as Case
participant "主耳机" as Primary
participant "从耳机" as Secondary
participant "链路质量监测" as LinkMonitor
participant "缓存管理器" as CacheManager
participant "流控管理器" as FlowControl
participant "存储策略决策器" as StorageDecision
participant "Flash存储引擎" as FlashEngine
participant "充电盒聚合器" as Aggregator
participant "充电盒存储" as Storage

== 场景1: 正常录音 - 缓存驱动实时存储 ==

User -> Case: 点击录音键(pressRecordButton())
activate Case
Case -> Case: 检测耳机状态(detectEarbudsStatus())
Case -> Case: 选择录音源(selectRecordingSource())\n决策: 充电盒MIC(类型=CASE_LOCAL)
Case -> Case: 初始化录音参数(initRecordingParams())\n48kHz/48kbps/单声道

group 初始化资源 [资源分配阶段]
    Case -> CacheManager: createCacheSession(session_id=101, max_size=12KB, type=CASE_LOCAL)
    activate CacheManager
    CacheManager --> Case: cache_handle (threshold=80%: 9.6KB)
    note right of CacheManager: 分配12KB SRAM缓存\n高水位: 9.6KB (2秒数据)\n低水位: 2.4KB
    deactivate CacheManager
    
    Case -> StorageDecision: setCurrentSession(session_id=101, record_type=CASE_LOCAL)
    activate StorageDecision
    StorageDecision --> Case: 决策上下文就绪
    
    Case -> FlashEngine: openStoragePartition(partition_id=CASE_LOCAL, mode=OVERWRITE)
    activate FlashEngine
    FlashEngine -> FlashEngine: 检查Flash磨损计数器\n当前扇区擦写=8923次 (<100000)
    FlashEngine --> Case: storage_handle
    
    Case -> FlashEngine: writeSessionMeta(session_id=101, start_time=1698765432000)
    FlashEngine -> FlashEngine: 元数据双备份(扇区0/1轮询写入)\n写入位置: 扇区[erase_count%8]\n擦写次数+1
    deactivate FlashEngine
end

Case -> Case: 启动音频捕获(startAudioCapture())
Case -> FlowControl: configFlowControl(bitrate=48kbps, link_capacity=80kbps)
activate FlowControl
FlowControl --> Case: 流控就绪\n初始配额: 1500B/50ms
deactivate FlowControl

note over Case, FlashEngine: <b>▶️ 实时循环开始 (50ms周期)</b>

loop 每50ms (300字节数据块)
    Case -> Case: captureAudioBlock(duration=50ms)
    
    group 数据写入与缓存管理
        Case -> CacheManager: writeCache(data_chunk, timestamp, size=300B)
        activate CacheManager
        CacheManager -> CacheManager: updateUsage(+300B)
        CacheManager -> CacheManager: checkWaterLevel(current=3.6KB)
        
        alt 缓存达到高水位 (≥9.6KB)
            CacheManager --> Case: ALERT_HIGH_WATERMARK
            Case -> StorageDecision: emergencyDecision(cache_state=HIGH, spp_status=UNKNOWN)
            activate StorageDecision
            StorageDecision --> Case: DECISION_FORCE_FLUSH\n立即强制同步
            deactivate StorageDecision
        else 缓存正常
            CacheManager --> Case: STATUS_NORMAL
        end
        deactivate CacheManager
    end
    
    group 流控与存储决策
        alt 需要同步 (配额周期到或高水位触发)
            Case -> FlowControl: requestSyncQuota(data_size=1200B, priority=NORMAL)
            activate FlowControl
            FlowControl -> LinkMonitor: queryLinkCapacity()
            activate LinkMonitor
            LinkMonitor --> FlowControl: capacity=80kbps, loss=2%, rtt=12ms
            deactivate LinkMonitor
            
            alt 链路质量良好 (loss<10%)
                FlowControl --> Case: quota_granted=true, max_batch=1500B, timeout=50ms
                deactivate FlowControl
                
                Case -> StorageDecision: decideStorageStrategy(spp_status=GOOD, cache_level=60%)
                activate StorageDecision
                StorageDecision --> Case: STRATEGY_REALTIME_ONLY\n无需本地备份
                deactivate StorageDecision
                
                group 实时同步路径 (PUML主路径)
                    Case -> FlashEngine: appendToTempBuffer(data_batch, size=1200B)
                    activate FlashEngine
                    FlashEngine -> FlashEngine: 写入NAND页(cache_page)\n地址: 0x80000000 + page_offset
                    FlashEngine --> Case: 写入确认 (page_id=42)
                    deactivate FlashEngine
                end
                
                Case -> CacheManager: flushSyncedData(size=1200B)
                activate CacheManager
                CacheManager -> CacheManager: releaseCache(1200B)\n剩余缓存: 2.4KB
                deactivate CacheManager
                
            else 链路拥塞 (loss>15%)
                FlowControl --> Case: quota_granted=false, wait_ms=50
                deactivate FlowControl
                
                Case -> StorageDecision: decideStorageStrategy(spp_status=BAD, cache_level=75%)
                activate StorageDecision
                StorageDecision --> Case: STRATEGY_PARALLEL_BACKUP\n传输+本地备份
                deactivate StorageDecision
                
                group 并行备份路径 (PDF核心机制)
                    Case -> FlashEngine: backupSliceToNOR(slice_id=1501, data=1200B)
                    activate FlashEngine
                    FlashEngine -> FlashEngine: 计算备份扇区\nsector = 2 + (backup_idx % 2558)\n磨损均衡: 当前索引=8923
                    FlashEngine -> FlashEngine: 擦除扇区 (sector=157)
                    FlashEngine -> FlashEngine: 按页写入 (page_count=5)\n起始地址: 0x9E2000 + sector*4KB
                    FlashEngine -> FlashEngine: 计算CRC32, 生成元数据
                    FlashEngine -> FlashEngine: 双备份元数据到扇区[0/1]
                    FlashEngine --> Case: 备份完成 (STATUS_OK)
                    deactivate FlashEngine
                end
            end
        
        else 无需同步 (缓存未满且未到周期)
            Case -> CacheManager: keepBuffering()
        end
    end
end

note over Case, FlashEngine: <b>▶️ 实时循环结束</b>
deactivate Case

== 场景2: 主耳录音 - 缓存受限与质量自适应 ==

User -> Case: 开盒取出双耳 (L电量78%, R电量82%)
Case -> Primary: 蓝牙命令: assignMaster(role=LEFT, session_id=102)
Case -> Secondary: assignSlave(role=RIGHT, session_id=102)

User -> Case: 点击录音键
Case -> Primary: startEarbudRecording(session_id=102, type=CALL_RECORD)

activate Primary
Primary -> Primary: 检测为主耳\n启动MIC捕获

group 耳机端资源初始化 (RAM更紧张)
    Primary -> CacheManager: createCacheSession(session_id=102, max_size=8KB, type=CALL_RECORD)
    activate CacheManager
    CacheManager --> Primary: cache_handle (threshold=80%: 6.4KB)
    note right of CacheManager: 耳机SRAM限制: 仅8KB\n约1.3秒缓存\n高水位: 6.4KB
    deactivate CacheManager
    
    Primary -> StorageDecision: setCurrentSession(session_id=102, record_type=CALL_RECORD)
    Primary -> FlashEngine: openRemotePartition(partition_id=EARBUD_BACKUP)
    activate FlashEngine
    FlashEngine --> Primary: remote_storage_handle\n备份分区起始: 0x9E2000
    deactivate FlashEngine
end

note over Primary, FlashEngine: <b>▶️ 主耳实时循环 (30ms周期, 180字节)</b>

loop 录音持续中...
    Primary -> Primary: captureAudio(duration=30ms, format=opus)
    
    group 写入与压力检测
        Primary -> CacheManager: writeCache(data, timestamp)
        activate CacheManager
        CacheManager -> CacheManager: updateUsage(+180B)
        CacheManager -> CacheManager: checkUsageAlert(current=5.8KB)
        
        alt 缓存 > 6.4KB (80%阈值)
            CacheManager --> Primary: WARNING_CACHE_PRESSURE\n剩余: 200ms
            Primary -> Primary: alertHighPressure()\n触发紧急同步
        end
        deactivate CacheManager
    end
    
    alt 每200ms同步周期
        Primary -> FlowControl: checkBluetoothBandwidth(needed=12kbps)
        activate FlowControl
        FlowControl -> LinkMonitor: getRealtimeLinkQuality()
        activate LinkMonitor
        LinkMonitor --> FlowControl: quality=GOOD, loss=4%, rtt=18ms, rssi=-55dBm
        deactivate LinkMonitor
        
        alt 带宽充足 (capacity>60kbps)
            FlowControl --> Primary: capacity_available=62kbps
            deactivate FlowControl
            
            group 蓝牙传输路径
                Primary -> FlashEngine: remoteAppendWrite(data_chunk, size=1440B)
                activate FlashEngine
                FlashEngine -> Case: transmitOverBluetooth(data_chunk, session_id=102)
                activate Case
                Case -> FlashEngine: appendToStorageFile(path="REC_102.dat", offset=36600B)
                activate FlashEngine
                FlashEngine -> FlashEngine: NAND编程 (2KB页)
                FlashEngine --> Case: 写入确认 (耗时12ms)
                deactivate FlashEngine
                Case --> FlashEngine: 传输ACK
                deactivate Case
                FlashEngine --> Primary: sync_confirmed (rtt=35ms)
            end
            
            Primary -> CacheManager: flushSyncedData(1440B)\n释放已同步缓存
            note right of CacheManager: <font color=green>✓ 同步成功\n缓存释放\n使用率: 2.1KB</font>
            
        else 带宽不足 (loss>15% or capacity<20kbps)
            FlowControl --> Primary: capacity_available=15kbps (不足!)
            deactivate FlowControl
            
            note right of Primary: <font color=red>⚠️ 链路拥塞!\n无法实时同步</font>
            
            alt 缓存未满 (< 7KB)
                Primary -> CacheManager: keepBuffering()\n等待链路恢复
                CacheManager -> CacheManager: 预计可缓冲: 280ms
            else 缓存即将满 (usage > 7KB)
                CacheManager --> Primary: ERROR_CACHE_FULL_RISK
                Primary -> StorageDecision: emergencyDecision(cache_level=88%, link_quality=POOR)
                activate StorageDecision
                StorageDecision --> Primary: DECISION_DEGRADE_QUALITY\n码率: 48kbps→32kbps
                deactivate StorageDecision
                
                Primary -> Primary: applyBitrateReduction(new_bitrate=32kbps)
                note right of Primary: 牺牲音质保连续性\n数据生成速率↓33%
                Primary -> CacheManager: adjustThreshold(new_threshold=5.4KB)
            end
        end
    end
end
deactivate Primary

== 场景3: 链路中断 - 盲窗标记与有限缓存保护 ==

note over Primary, LinkMonitor: <b>⚠️ 蓝牙链路突发中断 (rss=85%)</b>
LinkMonitor -> Primary: onLinkBroken(timestamp=1698765600123, loss_rate=85%, reason=timeout)

activate Primary
Primary -> Primary: markBlindGapStart(seq_num=12450, timestamp=1698765600123)
Primary -> Primary: updateCurrentMeta(flags.blind_gap_start=1, link_rssi=-92dBm)

group 缓存剩余评估
    Primary -> CacheManager: queryRemainingCapacity()
    activate CacheManager
    CacheManager --> Primary: remaining=1.2KB (约200ms)\n警告: 缓存即将耗尽!
    CacheManager -> CacheManager: calcMaxHoldTime(1.2KB, current_bitrate=32kbps)
    CacheManager --> Primary: max_hold_time=280ms
    deactivate CacheManager
end

note over Primary: 关键决策: 280ms内恢复链路或停止录音

alt 尝试快速恢复 (优先级1)
    group 快速重连流程 (100ms超时)
        Primary -> LinkMonitor: attemptFastReconnect(timeout=100ms, max_attempts=2)
        activate LinkMonitor
        LinkMonitor -> LinkMonitor: 监听广播包/发送重连请求
        
        alt 60%概率成功 (<100ms)
            LinkMonitor --> Primary: reconnect_success (took=67ms)
            deactivate LinkMonitor
            
            Primary -> Primary: markBlindGapEnd(timestamp=1698765600190)\n盲窗时长=67ms
            Primary -> FlashEngine: updateMetaBlindGap(session_id=102, gap_start=12450, gap_end=12472)
            activate FlashEngine
            FlashEngine -> FlashEngine: 元数据双备份 (盲窗标记持久化)
            FlashEngine --> Primary: 更新确认
            deactivate FlashEngine
            
            Primary -> FlowControl: resumeSync()            
            note right of Primary: <font color=green>✓ 快速恢复\n盲区<100ms\n用户几乎无感知</font>
            
        else 40%概率失败
            LinkMonitor --> Primary: reconnect_failed
            deactivate LinkMonitor
            
            note over Primary: 重连失败,进入缓存保持模式
            
            alt 继续录音 (数据丢失模式) [用户可配置]
                Primary -> Primary: applySlidingWindowMode(enable=true)
                Primary -> CacheManager: setOverwriteMode(oldest_data)\n保持最后200ms
                note right of Primary: <font color=orange>⚠️ 新数据覆盖旧数据\n滑动窗口缓存\n持续时间: 始终200ms</font>
                
            else 停止录音保护数据
                Primary -> Primary: stopCapture(immediate=true)
                Primary -> Primary: flushRemainingToFlash()  // PDF: 强制备份剩余
                Primary -> CacheManager: clearBuffer()                
                Primary -> Case: notifyUserPaused(reason="link_loss")
            end
        end
    end
end

deactivate Primary

note over Primary, Case: <b>▶️ 中断期间: 仅耳机RAM缓存\n充电盒存储出现数据断层 (盲窗)</b>

== 场景4: 主从切换 - 预见性缓存与强制同步 ==

note over Primary, Secondary: <b>主耳(左)电量27%触发切换</b>
Primary -> LinkMonitor: evaluateSwitchNeed()\n左耳电量=27%, 右耳=65%, 阈值=30%

LinkMonitor --> Primary: switchRecommended(new_master=RIGHT)

group 预见性缓存启动 (切换前300ms)
    Primary -> Secondary: prepareSwitch(new_master="RIGHT", session_id=102, handover_time=300ms)
    activate Secondary
    
    Secondary -> Secondary: startPreemptiveCache(duration=300ms, overlap_mode=enable)
    Secondary -> CacheManager: createSecondaryCache(max_size=6KB)\n预录到独立缓存区
    Secondary -> FlashEngine: openFlashBackup()\n从耳本地备份分区
    activate FlashEngine
    FlashEngine --> Secondary: 预录句柄\nsector_start=201, sector_end=204
    deactivate FlashEngine
    
    note right of Secondary: 预见性缓存: 300ms音频\n约1.8KB数据\n存储到Flash临时区
    deactivate Secondary
end

group 主耳强制同步剩余数据
    Primary -> CacheManager: queryUnsyncedData()\n查询未同步到盒子的数据
    activate CacheManager
    CacheManager --> Primary: unsynced_size=2.4KB (最后400ms, slice_id=12447-12454)
    deactivate CacheManager
    
    Primary -> FlowControl: requestEmergencySync(data_size=2.4KB, priority=CRITICAL)
    activate FlowControl
    FlowControl -> LinkMonitor: queryLinkCapacity()\n评估切换窗口期链路
    LinkMonitor --> FlowControl: quality=GOOD (loss=3%, rssi=-58dBm)
    FlowControl --> Primary: quota_granted=true, max_latency=50ms, preemptive=true
    deactivate FlowControl
    
    Primary -> FlashEngine: syncRemainingData(slices=12447-12454, remote_path="REC_102.dat")
    activate FlashEngine
    FlashEngine -> FlashEngine: 遍历备份索引(backup_slice_idx=54)\n读取Flash备份数据
    FlashEngine -> Case: transmitSlicesOverBluetooth(slice_data, meta_info)
    activate Case
    Case -> FlashEngine: appendToStorageFile(slices, size=2.4KB, marker="SWITCH_HANDOVER")
    FlashEngine -> FlashEngine: NAND编程 (目标块=128+offset)\n标记切换点
    FlashEngine --> Case: 写入确认 (sync_duration=38ms)
    Case --> FlashEngine: 传输完成ACK
    deactivate Case
    FlashEngine --> Primary: 同步完成确认\n所有数据已安全落盘
    
    Primary -> FlashEngine: eraseBackupSectors(slice_range=12447-12454)\n释放耳机Flash空间
    FlashEngine --> Primary: 擦除完成
    
    FlashEngine --> Primary: STATUS_SYNC_COMPLETE
    deactivate FlashEngine
    
    note right of Primary: <font color=green>✓ 切换前数据已落盘\n同步耗时38ms\n充电盒存储完整\n耳机Flash空间释放</font>
end

Primary -> CacheManager: clearLocalBuffer()\n清空剩余缓存

group 切换确认与从耳接管
    Primary -> Secondary: sendSwitchCommit(timestamp=1698765601234, last_sync_slice=12454)
    Secondary -> Secondary: becomeMaster(session_id=102)
    
    Secondary -> FlashEngine: mergePreemptiveCache(session_id=102)
    activate FlashEngine
    FlashEngine -> FlashEngine: 读取预录数据(slice_id=12455-12460)\n时间戳: 1698765601234-1294\n检查与原主耳数据重叠
    FlashEngine -> FlashEngine: 重叠检测: slice_id=12455-60 vs 12447-54\n发现: 部分重叠(60ms)
    
    alt 重叠窗口处理
        FlashEngine -> FlashEngine: discardOverlapped(preemptive_slices=12455-57)\n保留原主耳数据(更可靠)
        FlashEngine -> FlashEngine: retainNonOverlapped(slices=12458-60)\n标记为新数据
    end
    
    FlashEngine --> Secondary: 合并完成\n新增有效分片: 3个\n丢弃重叠: 3个
    deactivate FlashEngine
    
    Secondary -> Case: notifySwitchComplete(new_master=RIGHT, session_id=102)\n无缝切换
    Case --> Secondary: ACK
    
    Secondary -> StorageDecision: updateMasterInfo(device_id=RIGHT)
    Secondary -> CacheManager: transferCacheOwnership()\n缓存句柄转移
    activate CacheManager
    CacheManager --> Secondary: 当前缓存: 1.2KB
    deactivate CacheManager
end

deactivate Primary
note right of Primary: Primary变为从耳
activate Secondary
note right of Secondary: Secondary变为主耳

note over Secondary: 新主耳继续录音...\n全局slice_id保持连续: 12461+

== 场景5: 录音结束 - 基于存储的智能合并 ==

User -> Case: 停止录音(stopRecording(session_id=102))

group 停止所有设备
    Case -> Secondary: stopRecording()\n停止主耳捕获
    Case -> Primary: stopRecording()\n停止从耳预录
    
    Secondary -> Secondary: finalizeLastSlice()
    Secondary -> FlashEngine: ensureLastSliceSynced()\n强制同步剩余数据
    activate FlashEngine
    FlashEngine -> FlashEngine: 检查未同步分片\n上传slice_id=12461-12465
    FlashEngine --> Secondary: 全部已同步
    deactivate FlashEngine
    
    Secondary -> Case: recordingStopped(session_id=102, total_slices=66, last_slice_id=12465)
end

group 启动聚合与合并
    Case -> Aggregator: initiateAggregating(session_id=102, sources=[LEFT, RIGHT])
    activate Aggregator
    
    Aggregator -> FlashEngine: loadSliceMetadataFromStorage(session_id=102)
    activate FlashEngine
    FlashEngine -> FlashEngine: 从NAND读取索引表\n位置: INDEX_FLASH_BLOCK_START=256\n块数: 2 blocks
    FlashEngine -> FlashEngine: 解析元数据,检测盲窗标记\n发现: blind_gap_start=1 (slice_id=12450)\nblind_gap_end=1 (slice_id=12472)\n盲窗时长: 220ms
    FlashEngine --> Aggregator: 66个分片元数据 + 2个盲窗标记
    deactivate FlashEngine
    
    Aggregator -> Aggregator: parseMetadataWithBlindGaps()\n识别三段: 12447-12449, 12450-12472(盲窗), 12473-12465
    
    group 分批聚合 (PDF机制, BATCH=50)
        Aggregator -> FlashEngine: loadBatchSlices(batch_id=0, count=50)
        activate FlashEngine
        FlashEngine -> Storage: readDataFromNAND(offset=0x80000000, size=200KB)
        Storage --> FlashEngine: 分片数据流
        FlashEngine --> Aggregator: slices[0-49]
        deactivate FlashEngine
        
        Aggregator -> Aggregator: sortByTimestamp(slices[0-49])\n时间戳升序
        Aggregator -> Aggregator: deduplicateBySliceId()\n去除重复分片
    end
    
    group 盲窗智能处理 (PUML策略)
        Aggregator -> Aggregator: detectBlindGapSeverity(gap_slice_count=23)\n时长=220ms, 数据量=0KB
        
        alt 盲窗 < 50ms [轻微]
            Aggregator -> Aggregator: interpolateAudioLinear()\n线性插值补盲
        else 盲窗 50-200ms [中等]
            Aggregator -> Aggregator: fillWithSilence()\n静音填充
            Aggregator -> Aggregator: addGapMarker(duration=220ms, type=link_failure)
        else 盲窗 > 200ms [严重]
            Aggregator -> Aggregator: splitIntoMultipleFiles()\n避免大段无效数据
        end
        
        note right of Aggregator: 当前盲窗220ms → split策略\n生成文件: REC_102_PART1 + REC_102_PART2
    end
    
    group 写入最终文件
        Aggregator -> FlashEngine: createFinalFile(filename="REC_102_CALL_20231031_143025.opus", type=CALL_RECORD)
        FlashEngine -> Storage: lfs_file_open()\nLittleFS文件系统
        Storage --> FlashEngine: file_descriptor
        
        loop 写入聚合后数据
            Aggregator -> FlashEngine: writeAudioChunk(data, size=4KB)
            FlashEngine -> Storage: lfs_file_write()\n追加到完整文件
        end
        
        Aggregator -> FlashEngine: writeMergerReport(blind_gaps=[{start:12450, end:12472, duration:220ms}], continuity_index=96.7%)
    end
    
    Aggregator -> FlashEngine: closeFileAndCleanup()
    FlashEngine -> Storage: lfs_file_close()\n确保文件系统一致性
    Storage --> FlashEngine: 文件句柄释放
    
    FlashEngine -> FlashEngine: eraseTempSlices(session_id=102)\n清理临时缓存区
    FlashEngine --> Aggregator: 聚合完成\n释放2MB临时空间
    deactivate FlashEngine
    
    Aggregator --> Case: aggregationResult(status=SUCCESS, files=2, blind_gap_count=1, continuity=96.7%)
    deactivate Aggregator
    
    Case -> User: notifyRecordingComplete(file_path="/record/call/REC_102_PART1.opus", quality_report="连续性96.7%, 盲窗220ms已标记")
end

deactivate Case

== 场景6: 异常恢复 - 断电与磨损均衡 ==

note over Primary, FlashEngine: <b>⚠️ 耳机端录音中突发断电 (电量0%)</b>

note right of FlashEngine: 断电前最后操作: 正在写slice_id=12463\n元数据已双备份, 数据已写3页/5页

group 重启后恢复流程
    User -> Primary: 开机重启 (power_on)
    Primary -> FlashEngine: checkPowerLossRecovery()
    activate FlashEngine
    
    FlashEngine -> FlashEngine: 扫描元数据备份扇区 (0-7)\n读取最新元数据 (erase_count=8925)
    FlashEngine -> FlashEngine: 校验数据完整性\nslice_id=12463: valid=1, trans_status=3 (备份待补传)\n数据页数: 3/5 (不完整)
    
    alt 检测到不完整分片
        FlashEngine -> FlashEngine: markPartialSliceInvalid(slice_id=12463)\n标记为无效
        FlashEngine -> FlashEngine: recoverLastCompleteSlice()\n回滚到12462
    end
    
    FlashEngine --> Primary: 恢复状态:\n- 最后有效slice_id: 12462\n- 待补传分片: 1个\n- Flash磨损: 扇区平均8925次\n健康状态: GOOD
    
    Primary -> Case: reconnectAndRequestBackup(session_id=102, last_sync_slice=12462)
    activate Case
    Case -> Primary: requestMissingSlices(from_slice=12463, count=1)
    Primary -> FlashEngine: readBackupSlice(slice_id=12463)
    FlashEngine -> FlashEngine: 从NOR备份区读取\nsector=157, page=0-3
